{"4796070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Herbalist's Hut", "steam_appid": 4796070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“The Herbalist’s Hut”</strong> is an atmospheric medieval herbalist simulator. Step into the shoes of a hermit medicine man living on the outskirts of a secluded village, where locals turn to you in desperate hope of curing their cursed ailments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXAMINE YOUR VISITORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/14aa931e58ceaf87e617556ba8512e0d.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/14aa931e58ceaf87e617556ba8512e0d.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/14aa931e58ceaf87e617556ba8512e0d.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, villagers plagued by bizarre sicknesses and plagues will arrive at your doorstep—suffering from everything from sudden hair loss and skin rashes to yellowed eyes and translucent skin. Carefully examine their bodies to find the perfect cure. But beware: it is not just the simple folk seeking your aid. Demons walk among them in human guise, hoping to deceive you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f8fc2a8513e4bdd2c9ca666771c42697.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f8fc2a8513e4bdd2c9ca666771c42697.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f8fc2a8513e4bdd2c9ca666771c42697.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consult your ancient recipe book and select ingredients tailored to the discovered ailments. Not all components go into the cauldron whole; some must be carefully prepared first—finely chopped or thoroughly crushed in a mortar.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREW POTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/c59e906c22f2ca2163f3bb93dbd09a1c.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/c59e906c22f2ca2163f3bb93dbd09a1c.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/c59e906c22f2ca2163f3bb93dbd09a1c.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the prepared ingredients to the cauldron. Ensure the order strictly matches the recipe book, or the potion will turn into something you never intended. Stir the brew thoroughly and hand the finished remedies over to your patients.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHAPE THE VILLAGE'S DESTINY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f7861d26cfa3e3f9ff9118ce236694c1.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f7861d26cfa3e3f9ff9118ce236694c1.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f7861d26cfa3e3f9ff9118ce236694c1.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the quality of your work, the better the village withstands the oncoming plagues. Save innocent villagers and poison the pestilent fiends to cleanse the land of the surging sickness... unless, of course, your plans entail something entirely different.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>“The Herbalist’s Hut”</strong> is an atmospheric medieval herbalist simulator. Step into the shoes of a hermit medicine man living on the outskirts of a secluded village, where locals turn to you in desperate hope of curing their cursed ailments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXAMINE YOUR VISITORS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/14aa931e58ceaf87e617556ba8512e0d.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/14aa931e58ceaf87e617556ba8512e0d.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/14aa931e58ceaf87e617556ba8512e0d.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, villagers plagued by bizarre sicknesses and plagues will arrive at your doorstep—suffering from everything from sudden hair loss and skin rashes to yellowed eyes and translucent skin. Carefully examine their bodies to find the perfect cure. But beware: it is not just the simple folk seeking your aid. Demons walk among them in human guise, hoping to deceive you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f8fc2a8513e4bdd2c9ca666771c42697.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f8fc2a8513e4bdd2c9ca666771c42697.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f8fc2a8513e4bdd2c9ca666771c42697.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consult your ancient recipe book and select ingredients tailored to the discovered ailments. Not all components go into the cauldron whole; some must be carefully prepared first—finely chopped or thoroughly crushed in a mortar.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREW POTIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/c59e906c22f2ca2163f3bb93dbd09a1c.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/c59e906c22f2ca2163f3bb93dbd09a1c.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/c59e906c22f2ca2163f3bb93dbd09a1c.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the prepared ingredients to the cauldron. Ensure the order strictly matches the recipe book, or the potion will turn into something you never intended. Stir the brew thoroughly and hand the finished remedies over to your patients.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHAPE THE VILLAGE'S DESTINY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f7861d26cfa3e3f9ff9118ce236694c1.poster.avif?t=1781529040\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f7861d26cfa3e3f9ff9118ce236694c1.webm?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/extras/f7861d26cfa3e3f9ff9118ce236694c1.mp4?t=1781529040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the quality of your work, the better the village withstands the oncoming plagues. Save innocent villagers and poison the pestilent fiends to cleanse the land of the surging sickness... unless, of course, your plans entail something entirely different.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the shoes of a village herbalist: examine the townsfolk, brew potent remedies, and root out the demons casting sickness upon the common people. Will you save the villagers... or side with the darkness?", "supported_languages": "Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/7f64131e4057f17f8b62f9d1f9dbae083dfb924c/header.jpg?t=1781529040", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/7cae8da3ff36c15daa81f7255c1567451536fbe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781529040", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4796070/7cae8da3ff36c15daa81f7255c1567451536fbe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781529040", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["M